msgid ""
"Usage Tips\n"
"\n"
"Select:\n"
"Highlight text (or a word) in the book, then press [AI assistant] in the poped up menu.\n"
"\n"
"Long Press:\n"
"- On a Prompt Button: Add to the highlight menu.\n"
"- On a highlight menu button to remove it.\n"
"- On the Close button to go back to the book in 1 step.\n"
"\n"
"Very-Long Press (over 3 seconds):\n"
"On a single word in the book to show the highlight menu (instead of the dictionary).\n"
"\n"
"Multi-Swipe (e.g., %1, %2, %3):\n"
"On the result dialog to close (as the Close button is far to reach).\n"
msgstr ""
"Iwellihen n Useqdec\n"
"\n"
"Fren:\n"
"Sberreq aḍris (neɣ awal) deg wedlis, syin sit ɣef [Amyinaw n AI] deg umuɣ i d-yettbanen.\n"
"\n"
"Tiɣezza taɣezzafant:\n"
"- Ɣef tqeffalt n Prompt: Rnu-t ɣer umuɣ n usberreq.\n"
"- Ɣef tqeffalt n umuɣ n usberreq i wakken ad t-kkseḍ.\n"
"- Ɣef tqeffalt Mdel i wakken ad tuɣaleḍ ɣer wedlis s yiwen n weḥric.\n"
"\n"
"Tiɣezza taɣezzafant aṭas (ugar n 3 tsinin):\n"
"Ɣef yiwen n wawal deg wedlis i wakken ad d-yeban umuɣ n usberreq (deg umḍiq n wamawal).\n"
"\n"
"Aẓway s waṭas (amedya, %1, %2, %3):\n"
"Ɣef tenɣruft n yigmaḍ i wakken ad t-mdeleḍ (acku tqeffalt Mdel tebɛed).\n"

